## TL;DR: Radiant Cut Yellow Gold Engagement Ring — Key Facts

The single most important rule: **yellow gold masks diamond color**. Buy G or H — not D, E, or F. In yellow gold, G and H look identical to D-F face-up. The price difference is [$700–$2,000 per carat](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?MetalType=yg&ShapeID=Radiant&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). Keep that money and put it on carat weight.

**Full ring prices — stone + setting = total (certified {{year}} market data):**
- Natural 1ct GIA G-VS2 + [Petite Solitaire YG $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$3,318 total**
- Natural 1.5ct GIA G-VS2 + [Petite Solitaire YG $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$8,704 total**
- Lab 1ct IGI E-VVS1 + [Woven Solitaire YG $965](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/woven-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-310896?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$1,832 total**
- Lab 1.5ct IGI F-VVS1 + [Petite Solitaire YG $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$2,510 total**
- Lab 2ct IGI F-VVS1 + [Cathedral Pavé Crown YG $1,800](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/cathedral-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315695?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$3,969 total**

→ **Best overall value:** [Lab 1.5ct IGI F-VVS1 radiant at $1,510](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29569681?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Petite Solitaire YG at $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$2,510 total ring.** A full 1.5ct certified radiant in yellow gold for under $2,600.

**Priority:** Set your Total Ring Number first. Put 75–80% on the stone. Choose G color. Then pick a setting from what remains.

