## Lab Radiant Cut Yellow Gold Ring Prices

Lab radiant cuts are physically and chemically identical to natural diamonds. IGI-certified lab stones carry the same D-Z color grades and the same VS2/VS1/VVS clarity grades. The only difference is origin — and the price is 70–85% lower.

The color advantage in yellow gold applies equally to lab stones. Lab diamonds are readily available in D-E color at low premiums over F-G. In white gold, that D or E color matters visually. In yellow gold, F or G lab gives the same face-up result as D — you save money and add it to carat weight.

