**$2,500–$4,000 — natural 1ct GIA OR lab 2ct.**
At $3,318 you get [1ct GIA G-VS2 natural](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Petite Solitaire YG $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — GIA certified, G-VS2, yellow gold. At $3,969 you get [2ct IGI F-VVS1 lab](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27801066?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Cathedral Pavé Crown YG $1,800](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/cathedral-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315695?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — two full certified carats in crown pavé yellow gold. The lab 2ct is more stone per dollar. The natural 1ct carries a GIA certificate.

**$4,000–$10,000 — natural 1.5ct options.**
The [1.5ct GIA G-VS2 natural at $7,704](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29651855?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Petite Solitaire YG $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = $8,704 total. The [E-VS1 natural at $7,844](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28090460?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Cathedral Pavé Crown YG $1,800](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/cathedral-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315695?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = $9,644. In yellow gold, buy the G-VS2, not the E-VS1.

**$10,000+ — natural 2ct statement ring.**
The [2ct GIA D-VS2](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/16750163?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) at $17,714 + [Cathedral Pavé Crown YG $1,800](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/cathedral-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315695?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = $19,514 total. Full luxury territory — D, VS2, 2ct natural GIA, crown pavé setting.

