[1ct GIA G-VS2 natural at $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Petite Solitaire YG at $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$3,318 total.** Buy G, not D-F. Yellow gold makes the $1,500 color premium invisible. GIA certified.

