## Expert Summary

A radiant cut yellow gold engagement ring is one of the smartest combinations in the current certified diamond market.

Yellow gold masks color. Buy G or H instead of D-F — save $700–$2,000 per carat with zero visible difference face-up. Use that saving for more carat weight or a better setting.

This rule alone changes your budget entirely.

The radiant cut has 70 facets — more than any comparable fancy shape. In warm yellow gold light, those facets fire with a character that no other metal-shape pairing produces.

It is not just sparkle. It is warm, directional fire.

