**Maximum visual impact under $4K:** [2ct IGI F-VVS1 lab at $2,169](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27801066?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Cathedral Pavé Crown YG at $1,800](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/cathedral-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315695?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$3,969 total.** Two certified carats, crown pavé setting, yellow gold fire. Nothing under $4,000 outperforms this.

